{"unit_id":"Smartloe__dsh-catpaw#caveat-2","repo":"Smartloe/dsh-catpaw","commit":"2e2258c3f8e2085f5c01da701aafcafed899c825","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-catpaw 将扫码登录凭据保存到本机 ~/.meituan-catpaw/auth.json；包内 catpaw-cli 为 macOS arm64，其他环境需指定可用的 CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["login.mjs:195-205"]}
